der-border bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:border-primary/60 hover:shadow-[0_16px_40px_-28px_hsl(220_40%_25%/0.5)] active:scale-[0.99]" href="/ia/agentes"><span><span class="block font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Agentes</span><span class="mt-1 block text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Agentes conectados a tus sistemas.</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="group flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border border-border bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:border-primary/60 hover:shadow-[0_16px_40px_-28px_hsl(220_40%_25%/0.5)] active:scale-[0.99]" href="/ia/rag-privada"><span><span class="block font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">IA privada y RAG</span><span class="mt-1 block text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Privacidad, permisos y consulta documental.</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="group flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border border-border bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:border-primary/60 hover:shadow-[0_16px_40px_-28px_hsl(220_40%_25%/0.5)] active:scale-[0.99]" href="/ia/integraciones"><span><span class="block font-display text-base font-semibold text-[hsl(var(--ink))]">Integraciones</span><span class="mt-1 block text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Micro